<sect1 id="chapter2_1autotoc_md82_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter2_1autotoc_md82">
<title>Test design</title><para>Write tests for normal, malformed, and boundary cases. Use small CNF files so failures are obvious and reproducible. Check exact exceptions or statuses to prevent silent behavior drift.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>-S<sp/>.<sp/>-B<sp/>build/sat-tests<sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_TESTS=ON</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--build<sp/>build/sat-tests<sp/>-j</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctest<sp/>--test-dir<sp/>build/sat-tests<sp/>-R<sp/>sattyre-sat-parser-test<sp/>--output-on-failure</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
