<sect1 id="chapter2_1autotoc_md84_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter2_1autotoc_md84">
<title>Chapter summary</title><para>SAT correctness begins with a strict parser, not with advanced solver heuristics. If parser behavior is unstable, downstream solver and CLI behavior cannot be trusted. Treat parse errors as first-class API outcomes.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>Good<sp/>parser<sp/>output<sp/>should<sp/>be<sp/>deterministic<sp/>for<sp/>a<sp/>given<sp/>input.</highlight></codeline>
